When the student levels up, show a tasteful celebratory overlay with confetti or particles, a brief scale animation, the new level, and the actual XP threshold reached.

The celebration must appear once per level transition, not every time the dashboard recomposes.

If the app is closed when a level is reached, record the transition or notification so the event is not silently lost.

Do not reset progress when the student spends XP in the reward shop.

